%N A275887 Lengths of successive runs of identical terms in A275885.
%C A275887 Run length transform of A275885.
%C A275887 For n < 500000, the first occurrence of a(n)=1..9 is at n=(7, 1, 29, 14, 4, 22, 64, 178, 534), and of a(n)=11 at n=230. - _Lars Blomberg_, Feb 02 2017
%C A275887 The terms are exactly 1, ..., 9 and 11; in particular, 10 never appears (Ho, 2026). - _Boon Suan Ho_, Sep 28 2026
